            "id": "s2:p1",
            "text": "Plants of the World Online account: Drosanthemum intermedium L.Bolus."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2:p2",
            "text": "The native range of this species is SW. Cape Prov. It is a succulent subshrub and grows primarily in the desert or dry shrubland biome."
          }
